    <!-- FOR TOP GAME APPS: Differentiated scoring and switching strategy customization
         Two points to note:
         1. The game is latency-sensitive, requiring pre-configuration of cellular data，
            need to add this game to the list of SMART_ASSISTANT_PRE_SETUP_CELLULAR_GAME_APP in connectivity_wifi_smartassistant.xml.
         2. The game has third-party latency, but it's not very accurate; it still need to use L2 link scoring for wifi qoe.
            need to add this game to the app_list of gameLatencyNoIgnoreChannelQos in connectivity_wifi_qoe.xml.
